reviews.text:
Update: latest this update has just ruined what was a useful app. I wondered did they even test it because on an iPhone 13 Pro there is text now overlapping?
//
Had to delete it for a while because it started malfunctioning (stopped blocking apps during the time I had said and kept blocking them after) but I’ve updated and it’s all working again even better than before. Excellent though — feel like it helps me to concentrate when I need to be concentrating! i’m worried about binging though on the weekend or after work time but I think there are other methods in the app of limiting screen time during those periods. Frankly though, I think if this doesn’t work, I’m going back to a brick phone, carrying a camera everywhere like I always did, and an MP3 player.
